{"id":"5c8fcd5a2bc3a582","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-e-splitting.md","title":"Oracle 泛函的 e-分裂","display":"df-e-splitting — Oracle 泛函的 e-分裂","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-e-splitting","aliases":["20-df-e-splitting"],"display":"df-e-splitting — Oracle 泛函的 e-分裂","chapter":"12","section":"12.1","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definitions 12.1.6–12.1.7","source_pdf_pages":[228,229],"source_printed_pages":[198,199],"depends_on":["[[20-df-function-tree]]","[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-e-splitting"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-e-splitting</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-e-splitting — Oracle 泛函的 e-分裂"},{"key":"chapter","html":"12"},{"key":"section","html":"12.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definitions 12.1.6–12.1.7"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>228</span><span>229</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>198</span><span>199</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a4daa2d7bdea73d3\" href=\"?note=a4daa2d7bdea73d3\" title=\"20-df-function-tree\">20-df-function-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\omega\">\\(e\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta,\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T)\">\\(\\eta,\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FTree}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{FTree}(T)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a4daa2d7bdea73d3\" href=\"?note=a4daa2d7bdea73d3\" title=\"20-df-function-tree\">20-df-function-tree</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}e\\text{-}splitting}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{ESplit}_e(\\sigma,\\tau;\\eta,T)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\eta\\prec\\sigma\\land\\eta\\prec\\tau\\land\n\\exists x,y,z\\ [\\Phi_e^\\sigma(x)\\downarrow=y\\land\\Phi_e^\\tau(x)\\downarrow=z\\land y\\ne z],\\\\\n\\operatorname{EWhite}(T,e)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{dom}(T)=2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall\\alpha\\\n\\operatorname{ESplit}_e(T(\\alpha^\\frown0),T(\\alpha^\\frown1);T(\\alpha),T),\\\\\n\\operatorname{EBlack}(T,e)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{dom}(T)=2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\neg\\exists\\eta,\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T)\\\n\\operatorname{ESplit}_e(\\sigma,\\tau;\\eta,T).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}e\\text{-}splitting}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{ESplit}_e(\\sigma,\\tau;\\eta,T)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\eta\\prec\\sigma\\land\\eta\\prec\\tau\\land\n\\exists x,y,z\\ [\\Phi_e^\\sigma(x)\\downarrow=y\\land\\Phi_e^\\tau(x)\\downarrow=z\\land y\\ne z],\\\\\n\\operatorname{EWhite}(T,e)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{dom}(T)=2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall\\alpha\\\n\\operatorname{ESplit}_e(T(\\alpha^\\frown0),T(\\alpha^\\frown1);T(\\alpha),T),\\\\\n\\operatorname{EBlack}(T,e)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{dom}(T)=2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\neg\\exists\\eta,\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T)\\\n\\operatorname{ESplit}_e(\\sigma,\\tau;\\eta,T).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>所有输出由有限 oracle 的停止关系给出，分裂能被 c.e. 搜索发现。两个输出值不同就保证输入串不兼容。全定义条件表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(T)=2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(T)=2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源：Definitions 12.1.6–12.1.7；印刷页 198, 199；PDF 第 228, 229 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-function-tree","status":"resolved","id":"a4daa2d7bdea73d3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-function-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-function-tree","status":"resolved","id":"a4daa2d7bdea73d3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-function-tree]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-function-tree]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"e\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta,\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FTree}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}e\\text{-}splitting}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{ESplit}_e(\\sigma,\\tau;\\eta,T)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\eta\\prec\\sigma\\land\\eta\\prec\\tau\\land\n\\exists x,y,z\\ [\\Phi_e^\\sigma(x)\\downarrow=y\\land\\Phi_e^\\tau(x)\\downarrow=z\\land y\\ne z],\\\\\n\\operatorname{EWhite}(T,e)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{dom}(T)=2^{<\\omega}\\land\\forall\\alpha\\\n\\operatorname{ESplit}_e(T(\\alpha^\\frown0),T(\\alpha^\\frown1);T(\\alpha),T),\\\\\n\\operatorname{EBlack}(T,e)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{dom}(T)=2^{<\\omega}\\land\\neg\\exists\\eta,\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T)\\\n\\operatorname{ESplit}_e(\\sigma,\\tau;\\eta,T).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}(T)=2^{<\\omega}","display":false}],"bytes":1699,"backlinks":[{"id":"f2458da73bd8fe19","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-e-splitting]]。"},{"id":"94da30522fe93e7f","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-function-tree]]；see [[20-df-e-splitting]]；see [[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。"},{"id":"8ecc018639c40052","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-on-function-tree]]；see [[20-df-e-splitting]]。"},{"id":"0fdc06d93e560f03","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-e-splitting]]；see [[20-df-on-function-tree]]。"},{"id":"af068cd3cee16486","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-e-splitting]]；see [[20-df-on-function-tree]]。"},{"id":"c89da0dadf4f3bf5","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-on-function-tree]]；see [[20-df-e-splitting]]。"},{"id":"cb6a5dd98b8b185b","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-minimal]]；see [[20-df-e-splitting]]；see [[20-lem-minimality-tree]]；see [[20-df-jump]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-347","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":